# Generated theme token blocks live in src/styles/main.css. Prettier reflows
# the multi-line shadow declarations the generator emits, which then makes
# `npm run check:themes` report the file stale — the two tools cannot both be
# satisfied. The generator owns this file's formatting inside its region.
