# Same rule, same reason. landing/scripts/build-registry.mjs writes this
# snapshot byte-for-byte identical to the published landing/registry.json, so
# the two can be diffed to prove they agree. Prettier collapses short arrays
# onto one line, which would make every regeneration show a whole-file diff and
# would break that comparison. The generator owns this file's formatting.
src/components/baam/registry.fallback.json

